OL,3,ANew NHS-style social care system could
OL,4,Atake decades, Dilnot says
OL,5,
OL,6,FA new NHS-style social care system for
OL,7,FEngland could take decades to be
OL,8,Fimplemented, economist Sir Andrew
OL,9,FDilnot has told the BBC.
OL,11,FSir Andrew, who led a commission
OL,12,Fproposing reform of the system 15 years
OL,13,Fago, said Prime Minister Andy Burnham
OL,14,Fappeared to want social care to be
OL,15,Fcompletely free, including residential
OL,16,Fcosts.
OL,18,FHe told BBC Radio 4's Today programme
OL,19,Fthe cost of such a scheme would be
OL,20,F"very substantial".
OL,23,APub: 28-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
